libasnd (asndlib.c, asndlib.h, dsp/dsp_mixer.s), vendored from libogc v3.0.4 (https://github.com/devkitPro/libogc,
libasnd/ and gc/asndlib.h). Altered: see the "Octave:" notes in each file.

ASNDLIB -> accelerated sound lib using the DSP
DSP_MIXER -> PCM VOICE SOFTWARE PROCESSOR (8-16 Bits Mono/Stereo Voices)

